gpui-pre-windows 0.3.10
Upstream: https://github.com/zed-industries/zed (gpui-pre snapshot by https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit)
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE-APACHE is distributed with gpui-pre-windows.

Newport modifies gpui-pre-windows for key events that keep the physical key and
the layout's metadata, and window lifecycle, DPI, title bar, appearance, popup,
text input, file drop, drag and app ID handling for Newport's remote windows.
The changed files are Cargo.toml, examples/input_lifecycle.rs,
examples/input_lifecycle/windows.rs, examples/window_lifecycle.rs,
examples/window_lifecycle/windows.rs, src/app_user_model.rs,
src/client_frame.rs, src/events.rs, src/file_drop.rs, src/gpui_windows.rs,
src/native_characters.rs, src/native_drag.rs, src/native_resize.rs,
src/platform.rs, src/window.rs, src/window_appearance_tests.rs and
src/window_state.rs. All other published package files remain unchanged.
